"Ignacio, also called Shrike or Knife Guy, is an S-rank Knife Meister in Alden Thorn's CNH class."
"His skill The Leading Knife makes nearby blades chase his lead knife like a flock of birds."
"He is learning English, buys bulk old knives online and sharpens each with a spell."
"He cut off Maricel's ponytail during her combat assessment."
"His first language is Spanish, and he also speaks Hindi."
"He beat Alden in a no-powers duel, attacking from behind with a bowie knife."
"His grandmother is the Adjuster Aparna Sethi, and many relatives are high-rank Avowed."
"His creed: if destined to be a machine of war, he will try to be an excellent one."
"Li Jean accepted him into its Elites program, but his grandparents dislike its faculty."
"His family believes Earth's bill for joining the empire will come due in his generation."
"He is third-generation Avowed and has a younger sister."
"He gave Alden a fixed-blade knife for gym."
"In January 2041 his knife recall pulled Alden bodily through a preserved knife: Rabbit Recall."
"Badly hurt, he threw himself over the finish to win Konstantly Awesome's first run."
